text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_08170C26 {
    "I left my POKéMON at the DAY CARE.\pWhen I got it back, it had a new move\nthat I didn’t teach it.\lI was really, really surprised."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B926B {
    "Yawn...\pI must have drifted off to sleep while\nI was drifting in the waves."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B92B7 {
    "Ahaha, I lost...\nI’ll take a snooze, I think..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B92E7 {
    "Floating and being rocked by the\nwaves - it’s like sleeping in a plush,\lcomfy bed."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B94C8 {
    "Do you know a little town called\nDEWFORD?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B94F2 {
    "I hate this!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B94FF {
    "A weird saying is getting really\ntrendy at DEWFORD HALL."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B9538 {
    "Did you want to battle me?\nSure, I’ll go with you!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B956B {
    "I wasn’t good enough for you."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B9589 {
    "I think you’re going to keep getting\nbetter. I’ll go for it, too!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B95CB {
    "LISA: We challenge you as a sister\nand brother!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B95FB {
    "LISA: Awesome.\nYou’re in a different class of tough."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B9630 {
    "LISA: Do you have any friends who\nwould go to the beach with you?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B9672 {
    "LISA: If you want to battle with us,\nbring more POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B96AB {
    "RAY: We always battle POKéMON, me\nand my sister.\pI always lose, but we can beat you\n2-on-2!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B9707 {
    "RAY: Wowee, you’re at a higher level\nthan us!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B9735 {
    "RAY: My sister gave me my POKéMON.\nI raised it, and now it’s my important\lpartner!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMoro_G00_M22_Text_081B9788 {
    "RAY: If you want to battle us, go\nbring some more POKéMON!"
}
